WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.550
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.600
Make your wish.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:21.600
Your second wish is granted.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.350
What is your third?

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.770
Make your wish.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.310
I don't have any more wishes!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.620
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.100
No! No way!

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:15.320
I'd rather die than date you!

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:19.410
But...

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.870
That's too cruel, Yamabuki-san!

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.380
DELETE IMAGE?

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:38.590
Why does the bad luck all happen to me?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.340
INCOMING CALL
DUMB OLD MAN

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:43.350
Hmph! He just wants more money!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:48.660
How long is he gonna leech off his kid?!
He'll just gamble it away anyway.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:57.050
"The wish-granting Yamata-no-Orochi"?

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:58.920
CHAPTER 73

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:03.990
THE YAMATA-NO-OROCHI OF GREED

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:07.120
The Yamata-no-Orochi?

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:10.500
Yeah. There's a rumor
floating around the web.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:12.420
The one from the legend?

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.380
It doesn't look like it.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:18.010
"It will grant any eight wishes"?

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:23.140
The real Yamata-no-Orochi was defeated by
Susanoo-no-Mikoto.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:27.350
But Dad, it says, "Mt. Oguro."

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.540
Mt. Oguro...

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.560
Hmm. Don't ask me.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:38.030
I haven't seen him recently.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.820
Isn't he a Yobuko, too?

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:44.030
The one on Mt. Oguro is complicated
and a little hard to approach.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:51.040
No signal?

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.000
That sucks!

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.380
You there.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:58.630
Hey! Don't scare me like that!

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:03.590
Don't climb any further.
The Yobuko is out there.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:07.180
Th-The Yobuko? What the heck's the Yobuko?

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:10.520
When you give a holla,
you can hear it can't you?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.410
"Holla"? I've heard that somewhere...

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.940
You mean "holler."

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.440
Hello!

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.450
Hello!

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:27.870
See? It's the Yobuko of Mt. Oguro.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:30.790
Don't be stupid. That's an echo.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.580
The Yobuko protects the Orochi-sama.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.830
The Orochi?!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.130
Does the Yamata-no-Orochi really exist?!

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:41.780
I-It exists! That's why
you can't go any further!

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.590
So it does exist.

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:49.740
Hello!

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.130
Hello!

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:52.430
Hello!

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:53.850
Hello!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:55.370
Hello!

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:56.850
Hello!

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.860
B-By the looks of it,
I'd say I'm going the right way.

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:02.460
Hello!

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.190
Hello!

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:07.180
It seems closer than before.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.660
Hello!

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:12.290
Hello!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.310
Hello!

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:18.710
Hello!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.090
A-Are you the Yobuko?

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.590
A-Are you the Yobuko?

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.590
Are you the Yobuko?

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:28.090
Are you the Yobuko?

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:33.160
Are you the Yobuko of Mt. Oguro
who protects the Yamata-no-Orochi?

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.100
You want to see the Yamata-no-Orochi?

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.690
Huh?! Y-Yeah...

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:41.440
I see. You want to see him, too.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.730
Look.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:45.880
Take it.

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:49.950
Don't you want to see
the Yamata-no-Orochi?

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:05.210
Huh? What?

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:07.400
Where is this?

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:10.910
Huh? Where's the Yobuko? What's going on?

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:21.770
YAMATA-NO-OROCHI

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.300
It's the real thing!

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.530
Make your wish.

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:27.740
Huh?!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:29.660
W-Wish?

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.850
That is why you came here.

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:34.730
Make your wish.

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:36.290
THE WISH-GRANTING YAMATA-NO-OROCHI

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:44.420
P-Please spare me!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.630
I-I wish you'd let me out of here!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.590
Your first wish is granted.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:02.670
Tokyo?

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.230
I thought I climbed Mt. Oguro...

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:07.510
Huh?

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.000
This is...

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.250
It is not a dream.

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:23.830
The diamond talked!

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:26.960
You still have seven wishes left.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.690
W-Wishes?

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.640
A-Are you Yamata-no-Orochi-san?

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:36.700
Indeed. Did I not grant your first wish?

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:41.330
I-I wish you'd let me out of here!

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:48.110
However, I cannot grant vague wishes like
"make me happy."

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:50.610
I get it.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.760
Anything other than that, then?

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.530
Make your wish.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:59.220
Let's see... What would be good?

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:03.040
It has to be money! I wish for money!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:05.590
Huh?

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:07.260
Huh? Huh?

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.000
Where's the money?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.860
I get it. I was too vague.

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:13.430
I'll be specific.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:16.720
I want 100 million, no, 300 million yen!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.390
Your second wish is granted.

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:29.950
Yes, this is Fujio Saito.

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:32.380
Yes, Toshiki is my father.

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:36.120
What?! Died of a heart attack?!

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.450
Yes... Yes...

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.350
What?

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.120
300 million in life insurance?!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:51.220
I've missed drinking whiskey!

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:55.930
I didn't expect my stupid old man
to have life insurance.

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:55.860
BANK BOOK

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.100
Not bad, Yamata-no-Orochi-sama.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.520
What is your third?

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:01.720
Make your wish.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:05.110
Now that I've got money, next is a woman!

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:06.910
I wish for a girlfriend.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:10.020
Whoops, that's too vague.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:12.740
I wish to marry Sayaka Yamabuki!

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:16.720
Your third wish is granted.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:20.370
I get it, I get it.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.470
I just wait like this and...

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.250
There it is!

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:33.380
Wow. It's so pretty.

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:37.810
Thank you, Fujio.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.310
It's nothing, Sayaka.

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:42.140
I'm sorry. I should tell my mom.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.290
I'm sure she'll be happy.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:48.690
You're right.
Say hi to my future mother-in-law.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:50.590
Tell her soon.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:59.550
You took a diamond from
Mt. Oguro, didn't you?

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:02.030
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:07.920
That diamond radiates <i>yokai</i> activity.
Please give it to me.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.340
Don't be stupid!

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:13.230
I know it seems like it grants wishes,

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:18.220
but I'm sure it will bring you misfortune.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:21.410
Shut up! Go away, you brat!

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:23.970
I did warn you.

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:27.180
Huh?!

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:31.730
<i>What does he mean,
it'll bring me misfortune?</i>

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.530
<i>I'm going to find happiness with Sayaka!</i>

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:37.530
You're engaged to "Icky Fuji"?

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:40.030
No way. Talk about gross.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:44.080
My mom's company went under
and we've got debt.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.640
Anybody with money will do.

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:50.630
But Icky Fuji doesn't have money.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:54.760
I hear his dad died
and he got 300 million.

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:58.900
So I'll marry him, get divorced
and have him pay compensation.

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:03.910
You evil witch!

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:07.600
What is your wish?

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.560
I wish to end things with Sayaka Yamabuki!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:14.130
Your fourth wish is granted.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.530
What's that sound?

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.270
But...

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:33.830
It is what you wished for.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:38.880
I only... wanted to...
end things with her!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.800
And so you have.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:46.180
<i>I know it seems like it grants wishes,</i>

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.100
<i>but I'm sure it will bring you misfortune.</i>

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:54.610
So this is what you meant by
granting my wishes.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:58.610
YOBUKO

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:03.110
YAMATA-NO-OROCHI

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:02.010
<i>"I sense </i>yokai<i> activity."</i>

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.050
<i>"I didn't see that..."</i>

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:09.950
How does a million sound?

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.580
Sure. Whatever.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:15.060
Then I'll take it off your hands.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:13.650
PAWN SHOP

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:18.170
What an idiot.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:22.700
A diamond this size could be worth
hundreds of millions.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:27.870
Wh-Why?!

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.940
I just sold it!

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:31.500
I thought so!

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.270
I'll be taking my money back!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:37.520
You've got some balls to
steal what you sold.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:39.650
I-I didn't do anything!

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.340
We ain't here for excuses!

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:45.610
Now pay up.

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:49.370
F-Fine! I'll pay! I'll give it back!

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:52.330
It's all here I see.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.310
Now if you'll excuse me.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:00.340
B-But I gave it back!

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.300
We need something for our trouble.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.180
Hey. Go look for anything worthwhile.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:07.090
Got it.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:16.400
Boss, this guy's got
almost 300 million in savings!

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:17.730
Th-That's...!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.610
What?

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:22.710
That should just about cover it.

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:28.120
Saito-san, we'll take
that diamond as well.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:36.120
Goodbye, Yamata-no-Orochi!

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:40.630
That said, what should I do now?

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:44.240
My money's gone and my room's a mess...

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.930
Wh-Why?!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:51.810
Only four wishes have been granted.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:56.650
I cannot leave until the remaining wishes
have been granted.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:57.730
But...

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.020
Make your wish.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:00.940
No!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.240
I know the game you're playing!

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:07.830
You grant my wish and
misfortune befalls someone!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.660
No. Misfortune befalls me!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:15.120
And if it does?
Your wishes are still granted.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.500
Make your wish.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:20.340
You have a duty to make eight wishes.

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:23.400
Make your wish. Make your wish.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:25.590
Make your wish!

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.910
Make your wish!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.890
I wish you'd shatter!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:36.020
Your fifth wish is granted.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:48.950
You lied... to me.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:52.870
You were supposed to shatter.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:55.830
I shattered as you wished.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:58.870
I merely fixed myself after.

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:00.620
That's...

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.610
Make your wish.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:05.690
No!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.580
Three wishes remain.

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.080
Make your wish.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.630
H-Help me! Please!

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:45.960
I told you. I cannot grant vague wishes.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:48.050
It's not vague!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:50.610
I wish you'd disappear!

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:53.810
Why?!

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:56.600
Why won't you grant my wish?!

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.700
Make your wish.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.710
Make your wish.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.020
Make your wish!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.650
Make your wish! Make your wish!

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:07.950
Make your wish!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.570
Make your wish! Make your wish!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:11.530
Make your wish!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.210
F-Fine!

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:16.220
I'll wish! I'll make a wish, okay?!

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:21.810
I wish you'd bring me
someone who can kill you!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:34.720
Your sixth wish is granted.

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:41.680
I thought something like this
would happen.

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:48.650
We warned you, yet look at you now.
When you try to cheat at life...

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:52.240
Forget your speeches! Just help me!

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:56.470
I'm not obligated to help selfish humans.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:58.240
But I will this time.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:06.060
Stand back please.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:11.590
Kitaro, that diamond won't break easily!

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:14.220
I understand, Dad.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.070
Finger Guns!

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:30.800
Listen.

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:36.070
What do you think will happen
if I am gone?

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.260
I'll be saved of course!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.450
Did you really see Saito around here?!

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:47.960
I'm gonna shatter every one of
that bastard's fingers with a hammer!

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:50.010
Why...?

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:57.260
Even I cannot survive repeated
Finger Guns from Kitaro.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:01.110
You know what you need to wish.

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:05.770
B-But the yakuza will catch me first!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:09.230
If they do,
a fate worse than death awaits.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.520
Do you want that?

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:18.660
Make your wish.

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.030
Before I am pulverized.

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:28.620
I wish... you'd kill... Kitaro!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:32.460
Your seventh wish is granted.

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:44.910
Huh?!

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.480
What?

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:48.750
Kitaro...

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:50.960
The yakuza...

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.320
You tricked me!

00:18:56.470 --> 00:18:59.180
One more makes eight.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:00.930
Make your wish.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.040
Make your wish.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:04.720
Make your wish!

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:06.730
Make your wish!

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.210
Yobuko!

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:15.460
Yobuko.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.920
Please! Help me!

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.180
Please. Help me.

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:22.300
Stop joking around and help me!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.680
Stop joking around and help me.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.770
Now make your final wish.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.270
I shall grant it.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.780
I'm through!

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:36.150
I'm through.

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:38.570
I don't have any more wishes!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.400
I don't have any more wishes.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:45.000
Liar. Human greed is endless.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:47.120
You gained wealth and a woman.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.250
What is next? Status? Glory?

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.370
I don't want it! Leave me alone!

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:54.630
No!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.630
Make your wish.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.630
Wish.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:02.590
I-I wish I could give up my wishes!

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:06.260
Your eighth wish is granted.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:11.250
H-Huh?

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:14.000
Why...?

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:23.740
Back in the Showa era, I came here to
Mt. Oguro seeking the legend.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.830
And I became the Yobuko.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:28.490
It was the only way to survive.

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.200
Then...

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:34.800
That's right. From now on
you're the Yobuko of Mt. Oguro.

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:37.460
Whoops. This is for you.

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:39.710
This is your freedom stone.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:44.430
Only the Yamata-no-Orochi inside
can free you.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:50.230
You'll have to catch another idiot
who comes here believing the legend.

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:52.060
That's all. Bye.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:53.690
Wait!

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:54.730
Huh?!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:58.750
<i>I'm free, I'm free...</i> Whoops.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:04.130
Remember, when you hear someone holla,
don't forget to holla back.

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:06.870
Hey! Wait!

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:08.160
Hey!

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:11.310
Hey!

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:14.940
Hello!

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:17.060
Hello!

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:18.520
Hello!

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:20.590
Hello!

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:25.800
It looks like that human's
become the Yobuko.

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:29.730
It seems like it. How pitiful.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:33.060
I was worried about you
for a moment back there.

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:36.330
I'm sorry about that.

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:40.570
He was quite a shallow human, wasn't he?

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:44.030
Fortune and misfortune are intertwined.

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:47.790
When good things happen,
bad things always happen too.

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:52.080
To wish only for good things
is pure folly.

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:55.330
Don't climb any further.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:59.650
The Yobuko is out there.

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>Ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>Clop-clop-clop on a moonlit night</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>kankara kororin tsukiyo no ban ni</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>They gather to the clopping of geta</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>geta wo narashite yatsura ga atsumarya</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>Daddy Eyeball in his bath bowl</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>medama no oyaji chawan no furo de</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>A single lecture and everyone consents</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>sekkyou ippatsu nattoku</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>We teach the rampant ones a lesson</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>yaritai houdai no minasama niwa
okyu mo suemasu</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>We can't just do nothing</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>hottokenai desyo</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>To the mysterious GeGeGe Forest</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>fushigi na GeGeGe no Mori e</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>Take a deep breath together</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>issyo ni shinkokyu</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>So we can live happily</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>waratte kuraseru youni</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:04.670
<i>Dad, the last of
the Four Treasonous Generals,</i>

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:06.970
<i>the Kyubi no Kitsune has finally...</i>

00:23:07.090 --> 00:23:09.340
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:09.470 --> 00:23:12.430
<i>"The Fall of the Underworld?!
Tamamo-no-Mae's Trap"</i>

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:15.060
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
